  "what_happened_next": {
    "text": "Disney more than doubled, leading this set. The US share basket roughly doubled, and IBM nearly did. Wal-Mart lost about one-fifth of its value. The world’s political map changed, yet companies still followed different paths. Even a successful retailer could disappoint someone buying its stock at this starting date.",
